ATTRIBUTION

Credit "ModelRiskIndex" and link to https://modelriskindex.com. A dated
reference is strongly preferred, because every grade here is a point-in-time
assessment bound to evidence retrieved on a specific date:

    Source: ModelRiskIndex (https://modelriskindex.com), retrieved 2026-08-07

SOURCE MATERIAL

This licence covers our assessments, gradings, schema and prose. It does not
and cannot cover the third-party material those assessments cite — provider
terms of service, model cards, system cards, academic papers and news
reporting each remain under their own terms. `src/sources.ts` records the
licensing posture we understand to apply to each source. Quotes are reproduced
here for verification and criticism; if you redistribute them, satisfy yourself
that your use is permitted.

